Automatically generated code - ellipses definition
---------------------------------------------------*/	
/* ellipses: minor axis, major axis, distance to the ellipse center */
   double ellV1[] = {0.0400, 14.423, 15.000};  // vertical expansion
   double ellH1[] = {0.0200, 11.547, 39.000};  // horizontal expansion
   double ellV2[] = {0.0400, 13.484, 144.500};  // vertical focusing (defined from the sample)

/* -------------------------------------------------
End of ellipses definition
---------------------------------------------------*/

